        "title": "Lung rui tingkau ramta ning e",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Lungh rui tingkao ram ta ninga,",
            "Kandih rianra khang ngammei guai,",
            "Neihla na bammei tei hou e,",
            "Neihla mei lukhuan ‘zinghmei tei,",
            "Tingmik ‘thuih ai suan bam sini,",
            "Khou tei guang tangh khang khuan ngam mak.",
            "",
            "Zau keilou o, tingkao Guangh daih",
            "Ai hei rianra nanghna bam the,",
            "Ata pap riang rui banglouna,",
            "Nang ramh khou tei guangni sini,",
            "Theihmei le rianramei ruina,",
            "Tingmik ‘thuih ata duam.",
            "",
            "2. Lungh rui ninga guang tang nuh mak,",
            "Theihmei hei tinailou khou rui,",
            "Rianra rianriumei rui duamliam,",
            "Tangh khang khuan ngam makpui zaeng rui,",
            "Poubaomei nang bam gaimei tei",
            "Ai rui ninga kabma huay e.",
            "",
            "3. Tingmik kathui ai rui ninga,",
            "Ai rui rianramei hei thaina,",
            "Akhang rianra saeng khanga de,",
            "Kapbammei hei lungh neihlana khang,",
            "Kandi khou hei phung ngam makge,",
            "Tingmik ‘thui ai ning bam sini.",
            "",
            "4. Alau kumna kab bammei hei,",
            "Poubaomei rui lathau maksan,",
            "Ai rui rianramei maan lak khe,",
            "Apanti hei naibam san khou,",
            "Tingmik ‘thui ai ning bam sini,",
            "Poubaomei ai guang tan ngam mak."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
